    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 29:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nie Jufilisti gicoko dhu udulgi ceke karacelo i Afek: man Juisraeli gigonjo ng’et kulo ma ni i Yezrel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man rwodhi mi Jufilisti gicikukadhu ni dak, man ni rubanga; man Daudi ku dhanu pare gidong’ gikadhu cen karacelo kud Akic. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.29.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 29:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Judongomawijo mi Jufilisti gilund giwacu kumae, Juebrania maeni gitimo ang’o keni? Man Akic uwacu ni judongomawijo mi Jufilisti kumae, Maeni Daudi ngo, ma jatic pa Saul m’ubimo mir Israel, m’ubedo i bang’a i nindo maeni, kadi rundi maeni, man anwang’u kier moko mbe i ie ugambre i ceng’ m’etundo i bang’a cil i ceng’ maeni? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.29.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 29:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento judongomawijo mi Jufilisti kwinyo negogi i kume; man judongomawijo mi Jufilisti giwacu ire kumae, Keth ng’atuno doki, kara edok i ka m’ikethe i ie, man kud iyi walor wakugi i lwiny, emaru doko jadegi mwa dhu lwiny: kum janduni kindgi bipoto ku rwodhe ni kum ang’o? ni kum wi dhanu maeni ngo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.29.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.29.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 29:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.18.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 18:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.21.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "21:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maeni Daudi ngo, ma giwero pire man ni wadi man ni wadi ngo i mieli, giwacu kumae,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.29.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 29:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.29.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 29:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akic ulund ulwong’o Daudi, man ewacu ire kumae, Calu Yehova bedo kwo, ibedo pwe, wok woko peri ku mondo peri karacelo kuda i udul e ber i wang’a; kum anwang’u dubo ngo ii ugambre i ceng’ m’iwok i ie i bang’a cil i ceng’ maeni: ento rwodhi gifoii ngo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.29.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 29:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum kumeno kawono doki, man icidh ma cwinyi kwio, kara kud inyai lembe i kindwu wuku rwodhi mi Jufilisti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Daudi wacu ni Akic kumae, Ento atimo ang’o? man inwang’u ang’o i jatic peri ma nwang’u abedo i weng’i hai cil i ceng’ maeni ngi e, ma nia kud acidh akied kum judegi pa rwoth para m’ubimo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Akic uloko lembe ewacu de kumae ni Daudi, Ang’eyo nia in i ber i wang’a, calu malaika pa Mungu: ento judongomawijo mi Jufilisti giwacu kumae, Wabiidho malu wakugi ngo i lwiny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.29.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 29:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum kumeno kawono ai malu pir kugweno ku jutic pa rwoth peri ma wubino karacelo wukugi; man kinde ma piny ulero i wiwu, wuai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.29.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.29.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 29:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum kumeno Daudi ai malu pir kugweno, en ku dhanu pare, kara giai kugweno, gidok i ng’om mi Jufilisti. Man Jufilisti giidho malu ba Yezrel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.29.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
